'''Box of Grandmaster Marks''' is a [[container]] with a choice of a [[Grandmaster Mark]], which is used to purchase [[ascended equipment]] from the [[Structured PvP]], [[World versus World]], and the [[Fractals of the Mists]] vendors. The container can be received as a reward from the [[PvP League|Ranked PvP]] reward tracks or purchased from WvW vendor in exchange for [[Grandmaster Mark Shard]]s.

